            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<section id="mission" class="section mission-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="mission-grid">
            <div>
                <span class="section-label">MISSION</span>
                <h2>Proof Over Paper.</h2>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="large-text">Demonstrating capability through real-world web implementations and visible technical assets.</p>
                <p>By building accessible web layouts, responsive user interfaces, and structured technical documentation, this platform acts as an engine for professional growth.</p>
