                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="resume-block">
                <h3>TECHNICAL PROJECTS</h3>
                <div class="project-resume-grid">
                    <div class="mini-project">
                        <strong>Web Platform Architecture</strong>
                        <p>Constructed semantic HTML templates and custom CSS design systems optimized for web accessibility.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mini-project">
                        <strong>Digital Strategy Hub</strong>
                        <p>Engineered responsive web applications using vanilla JavaScript and modern layout engines.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div>
                <strong>TECH LAUNCH ROADMAP</strong>
                <p>Designed for skill demonstration and web development.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="footer-code">&lt;/&gt; Built with HTML & CSS</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
